<title>UK: ABB unit sets 150 mln Swiss franc Sept 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>ABB unit sets 150 mln Swiss franc Sept 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS Zurich.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ABB INTERNATIONAL FINANCE NV CURACAO</p>
<p> KEEPWELL AGREEMENT WITH ABB ASEA BROWN BOVERI</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    25.SEP.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.40    PAY DATE  S-25.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  STANDARD  LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   07.MAR.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) FIVE	GOV LAW    SWISS     SALE LIMITS US/NV</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
